#{\footnote # file_menu}${\footnote $ File Menu Commands}K{\footnote K File menu;New;Open;Save;Save As;Exit}+{\footnote + commands:010}
\pard\sb120\sa120\li120{\b\fs28 File Menu Commands}\par
\pard\li120\tx2160\sa60 {\b New}\tab Starts a new, untitled macro file.\par
{\b Open}\tab Opens a macro file saved earlier.\par
{\b Save}\tab Saves the macro file under its name.\par
{\b Save As}\tab Saves the macro file under a new name.\par
{\b Exit}\tab Ends the program, asking first whether to save changes.\par
\page
#{\footnote # macro_menu}${\footnote $ Macro Menu Commands}K{\footnote K Macro menu;Run;Record;Delete;Properties}+{\footnote + commands:020}
\pard\sb120\sa120\li120{\b\fs28 Macro Menu Commands}\par
\pard\li120\tx2160\sa60 {\b Run}\tab Plays back the selected macro.\par
{\b Record}\tab Records a new macro.\par
{\b Delete}\tab Deletes the selected macro.\par
{\b Properties}\tab Changes the selected macro's name, shortcut key and playback options.\par
\page
#{\footnote # options_menu}${\footnote $ Options Menu Commands}K{\footnote K Options menu;Shortcut Keys;Minimize On Use}+{\footnote + commands:030}
\pard\sb120\sa120\li120{\b\fs28 Options Menu Commands}\par
\pard\li120\tx2160\sa60 {\b Shortcut Keys}\tab Turns the macros' shortcut keys on or off.\par
{\b Minimize On Use}\tab Makes Recorder an icon while a macro records or plays.\par
\page
